# Physical keys wired to GPIOs on ASUS_P00I: home and volume up (volume down and
# power come from the PMIC, qpnp_pon, which Generic.kl already maps right).
#
# This file exists for one line. Without it Android falls back to Generic.kl, where
# key 102 (KEY_HOME, what this driver reports) is MOVE_HOME -- the keyboard's Home
# key, "move to the start" -- so the launcher moved its focus to the first item
# instead of going home. On a device's own buttons KEY_HOME means HOME, as the stock
# gpio-keys.kl says.

key 102   HOME
key 115   VOLUME_UP
